{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/Steam_description_First.gif?t=1744912746\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mushrooms and Spores</strong> take center stage in a Multiplayer-focused fitness battle!<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SporeBloom</strong> utilizes thoughtful asynchronous mechanics for surprise and discovery on every turn; you cohabitate the living environment on your quest to thrive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play With Friends or Solo (CPU)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your favorite spores with funky cosmetics - skins, caps, and magic spore staves!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>High Re-playability</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maps utilize procedural generation to foster innovative puzzle-like challenges, including varied shapes, resources, special tiles, and dynamic events. Develop extensive underground networks or concentrate on cultivating a diverse array of specialized mushrooms. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/Steam_descriptionGIFS_leading.gif?t=1744912746\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mycology Science</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SporeBloom</strong> is created by a solo mushroom enthusiast (Jake Collinge), inspired by real mushroom behavior and surrounding ecology: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat detritus \u2018waste\u2019 material </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parasitize opponent mushrooms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow above and below ground </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form mutual relationships to earn Nitrogen </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek out humus and other resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">React to the environment: wind direction, humidity and soil quality </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your underground territory </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cut off opponent resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026and much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Player Progression </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each playable <strong>Spore</strong> has secrets to unlock. Spend your match earnings in the skill tree to access new Blooms and playstyles, trait abilities, lab definitions and cosmetics. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Expansive Spore Roster (playable species)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SporeBloom</strong> will continue to expand post release, introducing new families of playable blooms, traits, abilities, maps and cosmetics, flexing the immense variety of techniques real mushrooms use to survive</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2895740?t=1744912746","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/a137b6452895abebbc1489d5f46dabf03618e89c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744912746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/428f6420d3baa0c08c039d0806d8cdca801f8ac1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744912746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/428f6420d3baa0c08c039d0806d8cdca801f8ac1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744912746","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/Steam_description_First.gif?t=1744912746\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mushrooms and Spores</strong> take center stage in a Multiplayer-focused fitness battle!<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SporeBloom</strong> utilizes thoughtful asynchronous mechanics for surprise and discovery on every turn; you cohabitate the living environment on your quest to thrive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play With Friends or Solo (CPU)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your favorite spores with funky cosmetics - skins, caps, and magic spore staves!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>High Re-playability</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maps utilize procedural generation to foster innovative puzzle-like challenges, including varied shapes, resources, special tiles, and dynamic events. Develop extensive underground networks or concentrate on cultivating a diverse array of specialized mushrooms. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/Steam_descriptionGIFS_leading.gif?t=1744912746\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mycology Science</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SporeBloom</strong> is created by a solo mushroom enthusiast (Jake Collinge), inspired by real mushroom behavior and surrounding ecology: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat detritus \u2018waste\u2019 material </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parasitize opponent mushrooms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow above and below ground </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form mutual relationships to earn Nitrogen </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek out humus and other resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">React to the environment: wind direction, humidity and soil quality </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your underground territory </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cut off opponent resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026and much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Player Progression </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each playable <strong>Spore</strong> has secrets to unlock. Spend your match earnings in the skill tree to access new Blooms and playstyles, trait abilities, lab definitions and cosmetics. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Expansive Spore Roster (playable species)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SporeBloom</strong> will continue to expand post release, introducing new families of playable blooms, traits, abilities, maps and cosmetics, flexing the immense variety of techniques real mushrooms use to survive</p>","developers":["Antigen Interactive Inc.","Jake Collinge"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/a70732c3a277b5d19d5e53f44f8557077af8c143/header.jpg?t=1744912746","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127381,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127381/movie480.mp4?t=1744912743","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127381/movie_max.mp4?t=1744912743"},"name":"Demo TEASER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127381/5c5f754b4a380f489cad014cf529e5c0ed573723/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744912743","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127381/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744912743","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127381/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744912743"}}],"name":"SporeBloom","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10 +<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br