ol. Produce fantastical mushrooms and expand to outgrow your rivals. Develop peacefully or parasitize your friends in multiplayer and solo play - may the fittest fungi survive!","steam_appid":2895740,"support_info":{"email":"sporebloomgame@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://www.sporebloom.com"}